# Plan mode

When planning **without implementing** (Cursor Plan mode, or user asks for a plan only):

1. **Do not write application code** during planning.
2. Save the finished plan to **`docs/workflow/planned/<slug>.md`** (no date prefix).
3. Add a row to **`docs/workflow/planned/README.md`**.

If Plan mode blocks file writes, persist the plan as the **first** step after switching to Agent mode.

Superpowers uses the same paths — see `.agent/skills/superpowers/SKILL.md`.
